      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرْحَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A single tree of the kind called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرْحٌ</span>
[q. v.]. (Fr, S, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A she-ass that has
attained to maturity but has not become pregnant.</i>
(O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرْحَةُ</span>, (O,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّرْحَةُ</span>, (K,) is
the name of <i>A certain dog.</i> (O, K.)

